# Settings › Home server › Alerts & power (docs/HOME-SERVER.md): looks at drive health (SMART), how full the drives
# are, failed or late backups and mirrors missing a drive, and tells you about what's new (a desktop notification, and
# optionally a note to your Tailscale devices). Started only by its timer, off until you turn alerts on. Never part of
# starting the PC, the session or Game Mode.
[Unit]
Description=Hearth home server: alerts
ConditionPathExists=/etc/hearth/home-server.json

[Service]
Type=oneshot
ExecStart=/usr/libexec/nimbus/hearth-home-server-helper alerts run
Nice=15
IOSchedulingClass=idle
TimeoutStartSec=10min
